* Netlist for simple circuit with a voltage source, resistor, and diode

V1 3 5 DC 2
R1 3 2 100
D1 2 4 D_generic
.model D_generic D

* Define nodes
* 3 - Positive terminal of voltage source and one end of resistor
* 5 - Negative terminal of voltage source (ground)
* 2 - Connection between resistor and diode
* 4 - Anode of diode, cathode to ground

.END